  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-006 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, and Kled. Version 0.8.2 gives Kled a rider-focused compact portrait, improves his independent non-locking Q projectile's practical hit rate without changing damage or cooldown, and makes Baron/elemental-dragon kill labels follow Baron Nashor and the seed-selected drake model. Kled remains an always-mounted three-skill Q/E/R replacement for Cavalry Knight (cavalry_knight, official 006). Includes the existing ImageGen actor, VFX, icons, Ban/Pick art, map surface refinement, and auditable audio. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
